Mood Playlist Generator

This project is a simple web application that lets a person select a mood and then generate a playlist based on that mood.

The Features I added:
1. Enter a name and choose a mood
2. Form validation to prevent empty submissions
3. Dynamic playlist generation
4. Mood-based theme changes
5. Favorite song button interaction
6. Local storage to remember the last selected mood

If I where able to update this SBA in the future I would add more moods and/or playlists, Possibly let people add their own songs to the list and if possible add a search feature for more music.